# Implementation Metrics Flow Diagram

## Purpose

This Mermaid diagram illustrates the overall implementation workflow for **Lab 11 – MVP Implementation Sprint 2**.

The diagram shows how the Smart Assignment Tracker prototype progresses from the Lab 10 working prototype through feature review, implementation improvements, testing, documentation, and evidence collection before completing Sprint 2.

## Workflow

1. Review the Lab 10 prototype.
2. Compare the implementation against the approved system requirements.
3. Audit completed, partially completed, and pending features.
4. Improve data handling and record management.
5. Enhance search, filter, and status update functionality.
6. Add startup/product metrics to the dashboard.
7. Test the complete user journey.
8. Capture updated screenshots as implementation evidence.
9. Update GitHub documentation and README.
10. Complete Lab 11 Sprint 2 evidence and repository updates.

This diagram provides a high-level overview of the implementation process followed during Lab 11.

